      "writtenOn": "2023-10-24T12:15:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does adding the new rule before removing the old rule work here? Some of our netd code supports this (ip rules in particular), but some of it doesn\u0027t (adding new configuration returns EEXIST, or it overwrites the old config, and then removing the old one removes the new one instead). Unless there is precedent for adding the new forward before removing the old forward, and we know this works well, it seems safer to do the remove before the add.",
